                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tail of a horse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae6ff94d-3fb0-314f-8899-38d0592c73d2",
                                        "entry_id": "495a5f5f-5bfd-3db7-893a-64d95b498949",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various simple vascular plants, of the order Equisetales, that have hollow stems and produce spores."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eee474a6-8b2a-3ae3-a266-ed72ed002541",
                                        "entry_id": "495a5f5f-5bfd-3db7-893a-64d95b498949",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Turkish standard denoting rank."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c852754f-cd45-490c-8a7c-2f0d568cbcd5",
                                                "sense_id": "eee474a6-8b2a-3ae3-a266-ed72ed002541",
                                                "text": "Commanders were distinguished by the number of horsetails carried before them. The sultan had seven, the grand vizier five, and the pashas three, two, or one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bb53971f-c7c3-3444-b3c5-cc181066c948",
                                        "entry_id": "495a5f5f-5bfd-3db7-893a-64d95b498949",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mare's tail, a water plant in genus Hippuris."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "43a81324-3361-3dc2-9abd-4c87d04a1da8",
                                        "entry_id": "495a5f5f-5bfd-3db7-893a-64d95b498949",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any waterfall, the descending water of which maintains contact with bedrock most of the time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a80296f-25af-3e45-be8e-3da8301c994a",
                                        "entry_id": "495a5f5f-5bfd-3db7-893a-64d95b498949",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "cauda equina, a bundle of nerve fibers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "685fbc37-7b5d-3bfe-9e42-1f6429562215",
                                        "entry_id": "495a5f5f-5bfd-3db7-893a-64d95b498949",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ponytail hairstyle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6c8bd95-27cc-4127-8343-ab97cbe3f839",
                                                "sense_id": "685fbc37-7b5d-3bfe-9e42-1f6429562215",
                                                "text": "They were psychic mediums that wore a horsetail hairstyle. They believed that their long hair acted as cosmic antennae to receive alien communication from beyond."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d37757d9-af57-4562-b0f4-854647c1217f",
                                                "sense_id": "685fbc37-7b5d-3bfe-9e42-1f6429562215",
                                                "text": "The woman was tall and rail-thin, bony across the shoulders and breast, with arms and legs of wire and gristle. A fighter, she wore the traditional haircut, shaved temples, roach of hair tugged back in a horsetail."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
